title: Presidential Election
view-if: year = 1934 and month >= 9 and presidential_election_1934_seen = 0 and president = "Simons"
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: presidential_election_1934_seen = 1;
tags: event
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: pres_election

@pres_election

The presidential election's first round is set to take place this month. If no candidate secures a majority, a second round will be held, with the candidate receiving the most votes winning the presidency.

- @final_election: The first round results...

@final_election
on-arrival: election_round = 0
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: post_election



@post_election
on-arrival: {!
Q.presidential_election_r2_trigger = 0

Q.bvp_votes = Q.bvp_votes / 100;

Q.dvp_candidate_votes = 0;
Q.reactionary_votes = 0;
Q.z_candidate_votes = 0;
Q.ddp_candidate_votes = 0;
Q.spd_candidate_votes = 0;
Q.hugenberg_votes = 0;
Q.hitler_votes = 0;
Q.thalmann_votes = 0;

// initial phase:
Q.hitler_votes += Q.nsdap_normalized;
Q.thalmann_votes += Q.kpd_normalized;

if (Q.hugenberg_campaign) {
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == "Hugenberg") Q.hugenberg_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
    if (Q.dnf_candidate == "Hugenberg" && Q.dnf_formed) Q.hugenberg_votes += Q.dnf_normalized;
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == "Hugenberg") Q.hugenberg_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == "Hugenberg" && Q.wp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.wp_normalized;
}


if (Q.reactionary_campaign) {
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.csvd_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.csvd_normalized;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.wp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.wp_normalized;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.cnblp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.cnblp_normalized;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.kvp_formed) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.kvp_normalized;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.dnvp_exist) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
    if (Q.dnf_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate && Q.dnf_formed) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.dnf_normalized;
    if (Q.other_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.other_normalized;
    if (Q.nsdap_candidate == Q.reactionary_candidate) Q.reactionary_votes += Q.nsdap_normalized;
}

if (Q.dvp_campaign) {
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.csrp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.csvd_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.csvd_normalized;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.wp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.wp_normalized;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.cnblp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.cnblp_normalized;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.kvp_formed) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.kvp_normalized;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.dnvp_exist) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dnvp_normalized;
    if (Q.dnf_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate && Q.dnf_formed) Q.dvp_candidate_votes += Q.dnf_normalized;
}


if (Q.spd_campaign) {
    Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.spd_candidate) Q.spd_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate && Q.csrp_exist) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.spd_candidate) Q.spd_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
}


if (Q.ddp_campaign) {
    Q.ddp_candidate_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.ddp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate_votes += Q.spd_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.ddp_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.ddp_candidate_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.ddp_candidate && Q.csrp_exist) Q.ddp_candidate_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.ddp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.ddp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.ddp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
}


if (Q.z_campaign) {
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.z_candidate) Q.z_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.z_candidate && Q.ddp_exist) Q.z_candidate_votes += Q.ddp_normalized;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.z_candidate && Q.dbp_exist) Q.z_candidate_votes += Q.dbp_normalized;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.z_candidate && Q.csrp_exist) Q.z_candidate_votes += Q.csrp_normalized;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.z_candidate) Q.z_candidate_votes += (Q.z_normalized - Q.bvp_votes);
    if (Q.bvp_candidate == Q.z_candidate) Q.z_candidate_votes += Q.bvp_votes;
    if (Q.dvp_candidate == Q.z_candidate) Q.z_candidate_votes += Q.dvp_normalized;
}

// check for majority
Q.reactionary_votes = Math.round(Q.reactionary_votes*1000)/10;
Q.dvp_candidate_votes = Math.round(Q.dvp_candidate_votes*1000)/10;
Q.spd_candidate_votes = Math.round(Q.spd_candidate_votes*1000)/10;
Q.ddp_candidate_votes = Math.round(Q.ddp_candidate_votes*1000)/10;
Q.z_candidate_votes = Math.round(Q.z_candidate_votes*1000)/10;
Q.hugenberg_votes = Math.round(Q.hugenberg_votes*1000)/10;
Q.hitler_votes = Math.round(Q.hitler_votes*1000)/10;
Q.thalmann_votes = Math.round(Q.thalmann_votes*1000)/10;

Q.reactionary_majority = (Q.reactionary_votes >= 50);
Q.dvp_candidate_majority = (Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= 50);
Q.spd_candidate_majority = (Q.spd_candidate_votes >= 50);
Q.ddp_candidate_majority = (Q.ddp_candidate_votes >= 50);
Q.z_candidate_majority = (Q.z_candidate_votes >= 50);
Q.thalmann_majority = (Q.thalmann_votes >= 50);
Q.hugenberg_majority = (Q.hugenberg_votes >= 50);
Q.hitler_majority = (Q.hitler_votes >= 50);
Q.any_majority = Q.reactionary_majority | Q.dvp_candidate_majority | Q.spd_candidate_majority | Q.ddp_candidate_majority | Q.z_candidate_majority | Q.hugenberg_majority | Q.thalmann_majority | Q.hitler_majority;

// check for plurality
if (Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.hitler_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.spd_candidate_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.ddp_candidate_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.z_candidate_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.hugenberg_votes && Q.reactionary_votes >= Q.dvp_candidate_votes) {
    Q.reactionary_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.hitler_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.spd_candidate_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.ddp_candidate_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.z_candidate_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.dvp_candidate_votes >= Q.hugenberg_votes) {
    Q.dvp_candidate_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.hitler_votes && Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.hugenberg_votes && Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.ddp_candidate_votes && Q.spd_candidate_votes >= Q.z_candidate_votes){
    Q.spd_candidate_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.ddp_candidate_votes >= Q.hitler_votes && Q.ddp_candidate_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.ddp_candidate_votes >= Q.hugenberg_votes && Q.ddp_candidate_votes >= Q.z_candidate_votes) {
    Q.ddp_candidate_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.z_candidate_votes >= Q.hitler_votes && Q.z_candidate_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes && Q.z_candidate_votes >= Q.hugenberg_votes) {
    Q.z_candidate_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.hugenberg_votes >= Q.hitler_votes && Q.hugenberg_votes >= Q.thalmann_votes) {
    Q.hugenberg_plurality = 1;
} else if (Q.thalmann_votes >= Q.hitler_votes) {
    Q.thalmann_plurality = 1;
} else {
    Q.hitler_plurality = 1;
}
Q.election_round += 1;
Q.new_candidate_r2 = 0;

// making the vote numbers nicer for the display
Q.reactionary_votes_disp = Q.reactionary_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.dvp_candidate_votes_disp = Q.dvp_candidate_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.spd_candidate_votes_disp = Q.spd_candidate_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.ddp_candidate_votes_disp = Q.ddp_candidate_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.z_candidate_votes_disp = Q.z_candidate_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.hugenberg_votes_disp = Q.hugenberg_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.hitler_votes_disp = Q.hitler_votes.toFixed(1);
Q.thalmann_votes_disp = Q.thalmann_votes.toFixed(1);

Q.dvp_r1 = 0
Q.spd_candidate_r1 = 0
Q.ddp_candidate_r1 = 0
Q.z_candidate_r1 = 0
!}
go-to: westarp_wins if reactionary_majority and reactionary_candidate = "Westarp"; eckener_wins if dvp_candidate_majority and dvp_candidate = "Eckener"; jarres_wins if dvp_candidate_majority and dvp_candidate = "Jarres"; luther_wins if dvp_candidate_majority and dvp_candidate = "Luther"; heuss_wins_dvp if dvp_candidate_majority and dvp_candidate = "Heuss"; hellpach_wins if dvp_candidate_majority and dvp_candidate = "Hellpach"; thalmann_wins if thalmann_majority; hitler_wins if hitler_majority; schumacher_wins if spd_candidate_majority; heuss_wins if ddp_candidate_majority; adenauer_wins if z_candidate_majority; hugenberg_wins if hugenberg_majority; no_majority_round1 if any_majority == 0 and election_round == 1

Results:

[? if reactionary_campaign: [? if kvp_formed and reactionary_candidate == "Westarp": <span style="color: #455B95;">**Westarp**</span>?][? if dnvp_left >= 0 and reactionary_candidate == "Westarp": <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**Westarp**</span>?][? if reactionary_candidate == "Adenauer": <span style="color: #000000;">**Adenauer**</span> ?] - [+ reactionary_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if dvp_campaign: [? if dvp_candidate = "Eckener" and dvp_campaign: <span style="color: #000000;">**Ec**</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">**ken**</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">**er**</span> ?][? if dvp_candidate = "Jarres" and dvp_campaign: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Jarres**</span> ?][? if dvp_candidate = "Luther" and dvp_campaign: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Luther**</span> ?][? if dvp_candidate = "Heuss" and dvp_campaign: <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**Heuss**</span> ?][? if dvp_candidate = "Hellpach" and dvp_campaign: <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**Hellpach**</span> ?] - [+ dvp_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if spd_campaign: <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**Schumacher**</span> - [+ spd_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if ddp_campaign: <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**Heuss**</span> - [+ ddp_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if z_campaign: <span style="color: #000000;">**Adenauer**</span> - [+ z_candidate_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if hugenberg_campaign: [? if dnf_candidate = "Hugenberg" and dnf_formed: <span style="color: #003755;">**Hugenberg**</span>?][? if dnvp_candidate = "Hugenberg" and dnvp_left < 0: <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**Hugenberg**</span>?] - [+ hugenberg_votes_disp +]% ?]

<span style="color: #8B0000;">**Thälmann**</span> - [+ thalmann_votes_disp +]%

<span style="color: #954B00;">**[+ nsdap_candidate +]**</span> - [+ hitler_votes_disp +]%

@no_majority_round1
on-arrival: presidential_election_r2_trigger = 1; spd_r1 = 1 if spd_campaign; ddp_r1 = 1 if ddp_campaign; z_r1 = 1 if z_campaign; dvp_r1 = 1 if dvp_campaign;
go-to: round2_menu

There is no majority in this round. In the second round, any candidate who wins a plurality will win overall. What should we do?



@round2_menu

- @round2_stay_on_the_race: Stay on the race.
- @round2_spd: Switch our support to [+ spd_candidate +].
- @round2_ddp: Switch our support to [+ ddp_candidate +].
- @round2_z: Switch our support to [+ z_candidate +].
- @round2_reactionary: Switch our support to [+ reactionary_candidate +].

@round2_stay_on_the_race

@round2_spd
view-if: spd_campaign and dvp_candidate != spd_candidate
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dbp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    Q.dvp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
!}

@round2_ddp
view-if: ddp_campaign and dvp_candidate != ddp_candidate
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.spd_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dbp_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    Q.dvp_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
!}

@round2_z
view-if: z_campaign and dvp_candidate != z_candidate
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.spd_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
    if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
    if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dbp_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
    if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    Q.dvp_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
!}

@round2_reactionary
view-if: dvp_candidate != reactionary_candidate
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.spd_campaign) {
        if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
        if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dbp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
        if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.spd_candidate;
    } else if (Q.ddp_campaign) {
        if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.spd_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
        if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dbp_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
        if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.ddp_candidate;
    } else if (Q.z_campaign) {
        if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.spd_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
        if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
        if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dbp_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
        if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = Q.z_candidate;
    } else {
        Q.spd_campaign = 1
        if (Q.spd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.spd_candidate = "Schumacher";
        if (Q.ddp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.ddp_candidate = "Schumacher";
        if (Q.dbp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dbp_candidate = "Schumacher";
        if (Q.csrp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csrp_candidate = "Schumacher";
    }
    if (Q.z_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.z_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.csvd_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.csvd_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.wp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.wp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.cnblp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.cnblp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.kvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.kvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    if (Q.dnvp_candidate == Q.dvp_candidate) Q.dnvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
    Q.dvp_candidate = Q.reactionary_candidate;
!}



@westarp_wins
on-arrival: president = "Westarp"; president_party = "KVP" if kvp_formed; president_party = "DNVP" if dnvp_left >= 0; new_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; new_middle_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0; old_middle_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; old_middle_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0; rural_kvp += 7 if kvp_formed; rural_dnvp += 7 if dnvp_left >= 0

Kuno von Westarp, a known conservative and nationalist, has been elected president.


@eckener_wins
on-arrival: president = "Eckener"; president_party = "I"; old_middle_dvp += 5; workers_spd += 5 if spd_candidate = "Eckener"; new_middle_ddp += 5 if ddp_candidate = "Eckener"; catholics_z += 5 if z_candidate = "Eckener"

Nationally renown Zeppelin pilot and independent Hugo Eckener has won the presidency! This is a moment of celebration for our party, as his victory helps keep the Nazis at bay.

@jarres_wins
on-arrival: president = "Jarres"; president_party = dvp_name; old_middle_dvp += 9

Perhaps surprisingly, Karl Jarres has made an unforeseen comeback and won the presidency.

@luther_wins
on-arrival: president = "Luther"; president_party = dvp_name; new_middle_dvp += 7; old_middle_dvp += 7

From former Chancellor to President, Hans Luther has secured the presidency. Known for his technocratic beliefs, he's unlikely to rock the boat in either political direction.

@heuss_wins_dvp
on-arrival: president = "Heuss"; president_party = dvp_name; new_middle_dvp += 7; old_middle_dvp += 7; pro_republic += 3

Theodor Heuss has unexpectedly won the presidency! With a committed <span style="color: #000000;">repu</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">bli</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">can</span> at the helm of Germany, the threat to the Republic has, for the most part, subsided.

@hellpach_wins
on-arrival: president = "Hellpach"; president_party = dvp_name; new_middle_dvp += 7; old_middle_dvp += 7; pro_republic += 3

WIP.


@heuss_wins
on-arrival: president = "Heuss"; president_party = ddp_name; new_middle_ddp += 7; new_middle_dvp += 7 if dvp_candidate = "Heuss"; pro_republic += 3

Theodor Heuss has unexpectedly won the presidency! With a committed <span style="color: #000000;">repu</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">bli</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">can</span> at the helm of Germany, the threat to the Republic has, for the most part, subsided.

@adenauer_wins
on-arrival: president = "Adenauer"; president_party = z_name; new_middle_z += 7; old_middle_z += 7; catholics_z += 5; pro_republic += 3

